<title>USA: IPO FILING - Emergent Group Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Emergent Group Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	     Emergent Group Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			EMER.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $11-13/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  1.0 million Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,622,100</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Wheat First Butcher Singer</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  450,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Diversified financial services company based in Greenville, S.C., that originates, services and sells home mortgage loans, small business loans and used car loans. Before this ipo, there was limited trading in the company's stock.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Repayment of debt.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s:     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $26,278	    $18,195</p>
<p>   - Net Income		 $657	     $2,338</p>
